{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You work  at the CSP Robotics company. The night is quiet and your shift is about to end. But the robots  have a different plan for tonight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Inspect anomalous robots</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each floor may host an anomaly. Inspect every robot for rogue behavior or hardware modifications.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619430/extras/RobotAnomalyGif_Belly_Compressed.gif?t=1743273376\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Leave the building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse in a liminal atmosphere. The rooms seem to repeat with no end. You will feel alone and surrounded at the same time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Scares, but not jumpscares</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There may be some sudden movement, a shape could run out of sight. But nothing will jump to your face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But don't lower your guard. Some robots may resort to violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619430/extras/RobotAnomalyGifRunning_Compressed.gif?t=1743273376\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20-60 minutes</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fail on the first 8 floors and progress will reset</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pass 8th floor and your progress will be locked</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go down to ground floor to unlock the anomaly museum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go underground to unlock all the anomalies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3619430?t=1743273376","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3619430?t=1743273376","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619430/3770fce7b2bd98ced505623dcb2449c9c749c4b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743273376","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619430/3770fce7b2bd98ced505623dcb2449c9c749c4b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743273376","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You work  at the CSP Robotics company. The night is quiet and your shift is about to end. But the robots  have a different plan for tonight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Inspect anomalous robots</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each floor may host an anomaly. Inspect every robot for rogue behavior or hardware modifications.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619430/extras/RobotAnomalyGif_Belly_Compressed.gif?t=1743273376\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Leave the building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse in a liminal atmosphere. The rooms seem to repeat with no end. You will feel alone and surrounded at the same time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Scares, but not jumpscares</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There may be some sudden movement, a shape could run out of sight. But nothing will jump to your face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But don't lower your guard. Some robots may resort to violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619430/extras/RobotAnomalyGifRunning_Compressed.gif?t=1743273376\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20-60 minutes</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fail on the first 8 floors and progress will reset</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pass 8th floor and your progress will be locked</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go down to ground floor to unlock the anomaly museum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go underground to unlock all the anomalies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Eibriel"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3583330","name":"Robot Anomaly"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619430/d08a7d3df8351253133e5103e3a039999e19d2d5/header.jpg?t=1743273376","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.2<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.3 compatible<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 10.13<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD4600<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257119948,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119948/movie480.mp4?t=1743273374","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119948/movie_max.mp4?t=1743273374"},"name":"Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257119948/2a18f061f8e8320d5a796e0cf32784c58259e9fe/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743273374","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119948/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743273374","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119948/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743273374"}}],"name":"Robot Anomaly Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_